  "date_building_work_completed_under_previous_permission": "08/10/2025",
  "lapsed_date": "01/09/2029",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "The retrospective development, by reason of the replacement of the historic timber shopfront with an unsympathetic aluminium framing system, roller shutter, and solid panel infill, has resulted in the total loss of a non-designated heritage asset of architectural and historic merit and has introduced a discordant feature that detracts from the character of the host building and the high street scene, which, in the absence of public benefits to outweigh this harm, is contrary to Policy HE7 of the National Planning Policy Framework, Policies D3, HC1, and E9 of the London Plan, Policies CS8, DM10, and DM12 of the Royal Borough of Kingston upon Thames Core Strategy."
  ],
